{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-1e1366a8f6997b970fa50457dd967967206edcc59c5b2a86","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"e939969533832c0e5600b5933b7001cad062a2e4a6c5e0f2dc5ac678e2e6eabe","article_count":0,"full_text":"■ Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act [Form No. 23] <Established Mar. 14, 2014>\n\nDECLARATION OF CONVERSION TO MANUFACTURING-PLACE UNIT TAXATION\n\nReceipt No.: ____________________\nReceipt Date: ____________________\nProcessing Period: Immediate\n\nDeclarant Information\n- Trade Name (Corporate Name): ______________________________\n- Business Registration No.: ________________________________\n- Name (Representative): ___________________________________\n- Telephone No.: ___________________________________________\n- Location of Manufacturing Place (Principal Manufacturing Place): ______________________________\n- Type of Business: __________________\n- Item of Business: __________________\n\nNumber of Manufacturing Places to Which Business-Operator Unit Taxation Applies: ______\n\nPeriod for Which Business-Operator Unit Taxation Is Waived:\nFrom ______ year ______ month ______ day\n\nDetails of Declaration\n\n| Classification | Serial No. | Type of Business: Business Type | Type of Business: Item | Location of Manufacturing Place | Trade Name (Corporate Name) |\n|---|---:|---|---|---|---|\n| Head Office or Principal Office | 0000 | | | | |\n| Subordinate Manufacturing Place | 0001 | | | | |\n| Subordinate Manufacturing Place | 0002 | | | | |\n| Subordinate Manufacturing Place | 0003 | | | | |\n| Subordinate Manufacturing Place | 0004 | | | | |\n| Subordinate Manufacturing Place | 0005 | | | | |\n\nReason for Conversion:\n________________________________________________________________\n\nPursuant to Article 25 (5) of the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act, I hereby declare conversion to business-place unit taxation in order to apply the method of filing and paying tax separately for each manufacturing place.\n\nDate: ______ year ______ month ______ day\n\nDeclarant: ______________________________ (Signature or Seal)\n\nTo: Head of the Tax Office\n\nAttached Documents: None\nFee: None\n\nInstructions\n※ Even where there are more than five subordinate manufacturing places, enter only up to five.\n\nPaper: 210mm × 297mm [wood-free paper 80g/㎡ or medium-quality paper 80g/㎡]\n\n[Source-wording note: The form title uses “manufacturing-place unit taxation,” while the declaration sentence uses “business-place unit taxation.” This distinction is preserved without harmonization.]\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\6359b73f81653f476890a6d46701142e73db5ca35ef65591706a8332ea1df4cb.ascii.json","sha256":"6359b73f81653f476890a6d46701142e73db5ca35ef65591706a8332ea1df4cb"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"a004ad3a1d00a7af8ad5eeac336ce56b09488041a67b8112131c0ee16bd531b0","unit_key":"form-002300F"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"a004ad3a1d00a7af8ad5eeac336ce56b09488041a67b8112131c0ee16bd531b0","source_law_id":"kr-006574-2702